# Trilium (TriliumNext) — NO required secrets.
#
# Authentication (username + password) is set in the first-run setup wizard at
# https://trilium.tabaska.us. That password ALSO encrypts "protected notes", so store it
# in your password manager — it must match on any desktop/mobile client that syncs to this
# server.
#
# Everything else is optional: any config.ini value can be overridden via a
# TRILIUM_<SECTION>_<KEY> env var in compose.yaml (e.g. TRILIUM_NETWORK_TRUSTEDREVERSEPROXY,
# already set). This stack needs no .env file — copy this to .env only if you add overrides.
